 "summary": "The median existence lemma and the critical-exponent Sobolev\u2013Poincar\u00e9 inequality are new: Mathlib and TauCeti have no median/quantile lemma for general measures. The proof reuses the existing weak-type BV Poincar\u00e9 inequality, W1p.hasWeakFDerivOn_posPartAbove, W1p.contDiffComp, the Embedding exponent helpers, eLpNorm_sub_setAverage_le and addHaar_real_ball_rpow_mul_diam_ball_pow_div_le, and none of its private helpers is directly replaced by a located lemma.",
